      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 6.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Okay, hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.15,
      "end_seconds": 8.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Hello, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.64,
      "end_seconds": 10.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.67,
      "end_seconds": 19.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "Ah, mainly no real problems. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.79,
      "end_seconds": 24.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.8,
      "end_seconds": 30.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "It's been going on for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.87,
      "end_seconds": 35.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.43,
      "end_seconds": 42.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "I'd say severe. And a bit of back stiffness as well, since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.56,
      "end_seconds": 52.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Did you get shortness of breath, chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.23,
      "end_seconds": 56.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Right, no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.62,
      "end_seconds": 61.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.17,
      "end_seconds": 64.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.19,
      "end_seconds": 68.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.89,
      "end_seconds": 73.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.31,
      "end_seconds": 78.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Right, what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.82,
      "end_seconds": 90.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.26,
      "end_seconds": 95.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.31,
      "end_seconds": 98.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "My father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.33,
      "end_seconds": 103.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.01,
      "end_seconds": 108.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.43,
      "end_seconds": 129.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Right, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.0,
      "end_seconds": 131.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.63,
      "end_seconds": 144.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.35,
      "end_seconds": 147.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.53,
      "end_seconds": 153.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.91,
      "end_seconds": 164.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.72,
      "end_seconds": 190.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, temperature is 36.4 degrees, blood pressure 110 over 73, pulse 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.98,
      "end_seconds": 193.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.7,
      "end_seconds": 197.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.4,
      "end_seconds": 203.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.41,
      "end_seconds": 206.11,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.54,
      "end_seconds": 208.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.58,
      "end_seconds": 225.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Your heart and lungs sound normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.65,
      "end_seconds": 233.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.58,
      "end_seconds": 257.71,
      "duration_seconds": 13.13,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, the most likely explanation is a healthy adult with no worrying findings. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.48,
      "end_seconds": 261.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.69,
      "end_seconds": 274.85,
      "duration_seconds": 12.16,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a healthy adult with no worrying findings, and we'll know more once the a cholesterol blood test is back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.48,
      "end_seconds": 307.57,
      "duration_seconds": 14.09,
      "text": "I'll request a cholesterol blood test, it'll help with routine check. Keep up regular exercise and a balanced diet. Do get help quickly if new symptoms appear. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.31,
      "end_seconds": 311.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
